---

## v1.6 correction record

Version 1.6 preserves every v1.5 owner and adds no new production-truth authority domain. The dialogue/lip-sync ownership correction remains unchanged: exact wording/language/speaker stay in A1, adopted spoken/facial acting stays in A7, and alignment remains derived evidence. Full Sound Post and the exact editorial authority model remain future.

The v1.6 refinement keeps exact source-media inspection, proxy generation, media-preservation evidence, materialization, and delivery lineage outside editorial truth ownership. It additionally classifies deterministic editorial resolution as part of the future ED-02 authority contract and distinguishes preservation conform, composition rendering, and mixed materialization as ED-04 execution capabilities beneath that authority. Authoritative editorial decisions remain **FUTURE DOMAIN — DESIGN REQUIRED** until G12 closes. No M15, M16, Performance, Editorial, Sound Post, or Finishing implementation is authorized by this map.

