# 6. Capability-shape summary

The baseline remains a deep vertical spine:

```text
story / semantic authority
        ↓
continuity + visual + spatial authority
        ↓
coherent Shot capture
        ↓
specialized observation/materialization
        ↓
execution + Take review
        ↓
historical isolation / recovery
```

The missing mass is the horizontal production-world layer:

```text
Production Objects / Revisions
        ↓
Composition Revisions
        ↓
stable addressable occurrences
        ↓
instance-bound persistent state + spatial continuity
        ↓
Composition ↔ Spatial binding
        ↓
revision-substitution compatibility
        ↓
Shot-resolution extension
```

Parallel missing branches include:

```text
within-Shot event timing + persistent handoff
performance revisions
physical relationships/contact
candidate-world ingestion
World Observation Compiler generalization
review-side consequence/promotion/QC surfaces
targeted correction / delta realization under preservation contracts
future approved-source editorial/conform branch with explicit media-preservation classes
proxy/source separation + exact source/output lineage
shared-subset equivalence + immutable capability snapshots for generalized execution
```

Nothing in this map replaces the implemented M1–M14 authority/capture/execution/history spine. The dialogue/performance capabilities extend it; M15/M16 remain separately planned. The editorial/conform branch is a future downstream design family and does not reorder the current frontier.

